@startuml 部署图-勤工俭学管理系统
skinparam nodeBorderColor #1890ff
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #e6f7ff
skinparam databaseBorderColor #722ed1
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #f9f0ff
skinparam cloudBorderColor #13c2c2
skinparam linetype ortho

title 部署图（物理架构）：Docker 容器化部署

node "用户浏览器" as Browser

cloud "Docker Host" {

  node "Nginx 容器\n(nginx:alpine)\n端口: 80" as Nginx {
    artifact "前端静态资源\n(Vue3 dist/)" as Frontend
    artifact "nginx.conf\n(反向代理配置)" as NginxConf
  }

  node "Spring Boot 容器\n(openjdk:21)\n端口: 8080" as Backend {
    artifact "backend.jar\n(Spring Boot Fat Jar)" as Jar
    artifact "application.yml\n(多环境配置)" as AppConfig
    component "文件存储\n(/app/uploads)" as Uploads
  }

  node "MySQL 容器\n(mysql:8.0)\n端口: 3306" as MySQL {
    database "workstudy 数据库\n(utf8mb4)" as DB
  }

  database "Docker Volume\nmysql_data" as Vol1
  database "Docker Volume\nuploads_data" as Vol2
}

' 通信路径
Browser --> Nginx : HTTP
Nginx --> Backend : /api/* 反向代理
Backend --> MySQL : JDBC
MySQL --> Vol1 : 数据持久化
Backend --> Vol2 : 文件持久化

note right of Nginx
  Nginx 职责：
  • 静态资源托管
  • /api/ 路径反向代理到后端
  • try_files 支持 SPA History 模式
  • 生产环境可扩展 SSL 终端
end note

note bottom of MySQL
  MySQL 配置：
  • healthcheck: mysqladmin ping
  • 初始化: init.sql 自动建表
  • 字符集: utf8mb4
  • 后端依赖健康检查后启动
end note

@enduml
